== Gameplay and Mechanics

#mod-entry(
  name: "DLC Timings Mod (ME2LE)",
  url: "https://www.nexusmods.com/masseffectlegendaryedition/mods/382",
  game: "LE2",
  version: "v2.2",
  last-checked: "2026-07",
